+&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE callback-write-to-log w-login 
+PROCEDURE callback-write-to-log :
+/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+  Purpose:     
+  Parameters:  <none>
+  Notes:       
+------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
+  define input parameter p-msg-str as character no-undo .
+
+  define variable lok as logical   no-undo .
+
